2. In this Act unless the context otherwise requires—       Interpreta-
"appointed day" means the day on which this Act comes Hon.
into operation;
"Branch" means any of the Branches of the British Red
Cross Society in Sabah, Sarawak or Singapore;
"Council" means the Council constituted under section 6;
"the Corporation" means the body incorporated under
the name of Persatuan Halang Merah Malaysia (or in
English the Malaysian Red Cross Society) by this Act;
"the former Corporation" means the body incorporated
under the name of the Federation of Malaya Red Cross
Society by the Federation) of Malaya Red Cross Society 4 of 1962.
(Incorporation) Act, 1962;

"Minister" means the Minister for Welfare Services.
